@Logistics.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5100

### RF-01: Consultar empleados (con filtro de búsqueda)
GET {{Logistics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&searchTerm=daniel
Accept: application/json

###

### RF-01: Consultar detalle de un empleado con sus credenciales
GET {{Logistics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/{employeeId}
Accept: application/json

###

### RF-01: Registrar un empleado
POST {{Logistics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificationNumber": "3344556677",
  "names": "Sofía",
  "lastNames": "Torres",
  "email": "sofia.torres@logistics.com",
  "position": "Analista de Inventarios",
  "area": 2
}

###

### RF-01: Actualizar un empleado
PUT {{Logistics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/{employeeId}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "names": "Sofía",
  "lastNames": "Torres Pinzón",
  "email": "sofia.torres@logistics.com",
  "position": "Analista Senior de Inventarios",
  "area": 4
}

###

### RF-01: Desactivar un empleado
DELETE {{Logistics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/{employeeId}
Accept: application/json

###

### RF-02: Consultar una credencial por su código
GET {{Logistics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/credentials/by-code/CRD-0001
Accept: application/json

###

### RF-02: Consultar credenciales de un empleado
GET {{Logistics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/credentials/by-employee/{employeeId}
Accept: application/json

###

### RF-02: Asignar una credencial a un empleado
POST {{Logistics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/credentials
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "CRD-0007",
  "employeeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

###

### RF-02: Bloquear una credencial
PATCH {{Logistics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/credentials/{credentialId}/block
Accept: application/json

###

### RF-02: Revocar una credencial
PATCH {{Logistics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/credentials/{credentialId}/revoke
Accept: application/json

###

### RF-03: Registrar una entrada (autorizada)
POST {{Logistics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-0001",
  "accessPointId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "movementType": 1
}

###

### RF-03: Registrar un acceso con credencial bloqueada (rechazado)
POST {{Logistics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "CRD-0005",
  "accessPointId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "movementType": 1
}

###

### RF-04: Consultar historial de accesos (filtro por resultado rechazado)
GET {{Logistics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access/history?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10&result=2
Accept: application/json

###

### RF-04: Consultar historial de accesos de un empleado en un rango de fechas
GET {{Logistics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/access/history?employeeId={employeeId}&dateFrom=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&dateTo=2026-12-31T23:59:59Z
Accept: application/json

###

### RF-06: Consultar puntos de acceso habilitados
GET {{Logistics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accesspoints?isEnabled=true
Accept: application/json

###

### RF-06: Registrar un punto de acceso
POST {{Logistics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accesspoints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bodega 2",
  "type": 3,
  "description": "Acceso a la bodega sur de mercancías.",
  "isEnabled": true
}

###

### RF-06: Deshabilitar un punto de acceso
PATCH {{Logistics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/accesspoints/{accessPointId}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enable": false
}

###
